{'symbol': 'TFX', 'date': '2022-11-03 06:30:00', 'title': 'TELEFLEX ANNOUNCES WORLDWIDE RECALL OF GIBECK® ISO-GARD® FILTER', 'text': 'WAYNE, PA., NOV. 03, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TELEFLEX INCORPORATED (NYSE: TFX), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF MEDICAL TECHNOLOGIES FOR CRITICAL CARE AND SURGERY, HAS ANNOUNCED A WORLDWIDE RECALL OF AFFECTED LOTS OF THE BELOW-REFERENCED GIBECK® ISO-GARD® FILTER PRODUCTS. THE GIBECK® ISO-GARD® FILTER IS A BACTERIAL AND VIRAL FILTER, INTENDED FOR CONNECTION TO RESPIRATORY EQUIPMENT IN INTENSIVE CARE UNITS AND OPERATING THEATRES TO PROTECT THE EQUIPMENT FROM POTENTIAL AIRBORNE CONTAMINANTS.'}